      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim GST credit on services provided by Packers And Movers In Claim?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, you can claim input tax credit on the GST paid for relocation services from Packers And Movers In Claim, provided the mover is GST‑registered and you have a valid tax invoice. Ensure the invoice mentions your GSTIN, the service description, and the amount of tax charged to claim the credit in your GST return.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required to file a claim for household goods moved by Packers And Movers In Claim?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To file a claim, you need the original booking receipt, a detailed packing list, the signed delivery acknowledgment, the IRDAI‑approved insurance policy certificate, and any photographs of damage. Submit these along with a claim form to the mover’s customer service within 30 days of delivery for prompt settlement.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance coverage calculated for items shifted by Packers And Movers In Claim?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Insurance is calculated on the declared value of each item, up to the maximum limit allowed under the IRDAI policy. Packers And Movers In Claim offers 100 % coverage for declared values, with a nominal premium based on total weight and distance. You can increase coverage by declaring a higher value at the time of booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the cost matrix for Packers And Movers In Claim?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost matrix for Packers And Movers In Claim is fully transparent. It includes base freight, fuel surcharge, toll fees, and optional services such as extra packing or stair‑case handling. Any additional charges, like special handling for oversized items, are disclosed upfront before the move begins.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What are the typical transit times for a move from Claim to the major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time for the 850 km journey from Claim to the hub is 12‑14 hours, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Packers And Movers In Claim monitors the shipment via GPS and provides real‑time updates, ensuring you receive an accurate estimated arrival window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer protective packaging protect fragile items during long‑distance moves?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system combines high‑density bubble wrap, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, stretch film, and custom wooden crates. Each layer absorbs shock, prevents moisture ingress, and distributes load evenly, safeguarding fragile items such as glassware, electronics, and antique furniture throughout the Claim‑to‑hub transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What should I do if my goods are damaged upon delivery by Packers And Movers In Claim?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Immediately record the damage with photographs, note any discrepancies on the delivery receipt, and inform the mover’s support team. Submit the claim form with the required documents (invoice, packing list, insurance certificate) within the stipulated period. Packers And Movers In Claim will assess the loss and process reimbursement according to the insurance policy.</p>
      </div>
